{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BEAT THEM ALL AND BECOME THE BEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've been chosen to take part in a great magician's tournament. You'll have to face one formidable opponent after another. Fight, prove your place and become the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287060/extras/gif2.gif?t=1729189085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IN THE SCHOOL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between each fight, you'll have the chance to improve your skills, as well as exchanging ideas and forging ties with your opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 unique boss fight with different mechanics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Create your own custom spell panel </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Skill tree that enhances your abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A story full of twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Cute world  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 2-3 hours of intense combat !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287060/extras/2024-10-14_14-23-20gif_1.gif?t=1729189085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3287060?t=1729189085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1729189085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287060/aa4dead6e1c10605dcfc24d04cf07f59362a66a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729189085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3